findings.suggested_fix:
Register a ValidArgsFunction on every profile-name argument. Cobra-idiomatic pattern:

cmd.ValidArgsFunction = func(cmd *cobra.Command, args []string, toComplete string) ([]string, cobra.ShellCompDirective) {
	s, err := loadState()
	if err != nil {
		return nil, cobra.ShellCompDirectiveError
	}
	profiles, _ := profile.List(s.Paths)
	var names []string
	for _, p := range profiles { names = append(names, p.Name) }
	return names, cobra.ShellCompDirectiveNoFileComp
}

This also lets agents call 'ccp __complete use ""' to enumerate valid values programmatically.

